        "original_id": "9768cdd5-f791-5e48-8547-afb319cbd9e9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Steve Wynn, Tom Fazio\n- Places: Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Nevada, North Las Vegas, Nevada, Atlantic City, Mississippi\n- Products: Golden Nugget, Golden Nugget Atlantic City, The Mirage, Treasure Island Hotel & Casino, Bellagio, Beau Rivage, Shadow Creek Golf Course\n- Topics: Las Vegas resort development, hotel and casino operations, golf course design\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, Steve Wynn built Shadow Creek, an 18-hole golf course in North Las Vegas, Nevada, and Tom Fazio designed it.\n- Early in his career, Steve Wynn oversaw the construction and operation of the Golden Nugget, Golden Nugget Atlantic City, The Mirage, Treasure Island, Bellagio, and Beau Rivage in Mississippi.\n- In the 1990s, Steve Wynn played a pivotal role in the resurgence and expansion of the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino is a hotel and casino on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino has 2,664 rooms and 220 suites.\n- Treasure Island Hotel & Casino is connected by tram to The Mirage and by pedestrian bridge to the Fashion Show Mall shopping center.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a3303731-0d02-50e0-9735-1a32a1e2dc85",
        "text": "Page: Steve Wynn. Sentence: Early in his career he oversaw the construction and operation of several notable Las Vegas and Atlantic City hotels, including the Golden Nugget, the Golden Nugget Atlantic City, The Mirage, Treasure Island, the Bellagio, and Beau Rivage in Mississippi, and he played a pivotal role in the resurgence and expansion of the Las Vegas Strip in the 1990s.\nPage: Treasure Island Hotel and Casino. Sentence: Treasure Island Hotel & Casino (also known as \"TI\") is a hotel and casino located on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada, USA with 2,664 rooms and 220 suites, and is connected by tram to The Mirage as well as pedestrian bridge to the Fashion Show Mall shopping center.\nPage: Shadow Creek Golf Course. Sentence: Shadow Creek is an 18-hole golf course in North Las Vegas, Nevada, designed by Tom Fazio and built by Las Vegas casino magnate Steve Wynn in 1989.",
